    How We Protect You
  </h2>

  <div class="feature-grid">
    <div class="feature-card">
      <h3><span>🔐</span> End-to-End Encryption</h3>
      <p>All conversations use WebRTC encryption. When direct peer-to-peer isn't possible, traffic routes through our private relay servers while maintaining the same encryption standards. We can't read your messages even if we wanted to.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-card">
      <h3><span>⏱️</span> Minimal Data Retention</h3>
      <div class="enhanced-list">
        <div class="enhanced-list-item">
          <span class="icon">🗑️</span>
          <span>Chat messages: Not stored</span>
        </div>
        <div class="enhanced-list-item">
          <span class="icon">📱</span>
          <span>Preferences: Stored locally when possible</span>
        </div>
        <div class="enhanced-list-item">
          <span class="icon">🔄</span>
          <span>Technical data: Deleted after matching</span>
        </div>
        <div class="enhanced-list-item">
          <span class="icon">📊</span>
          <span>Analytics: Anonymized and aggregated</span>
        </div>
